// MQTT requests for testing the runner during development, with the
// httpYac extension of VS Code or the httpyac command line tool.
// See README.md in this directory.
//
// The runner needs an mqtt section in its configuration with the broker
// and base topic below. Each request subscribes to the response topic of
// its route and publishes the request. The "=== wait-for-server" line
// keeps the connection open until the response arrives, and the empty
// {{ "" }} part after it sends nothing.

@broker = mqtt://localhost:1883
@topic = dtaas/user1/runner

###

# @name status
MQTT {{broker}}
Subscribe: {{topic}}/status/response
Publish: {{topic}}/status
QoS: 1

{}
=== wait-for-server
{{ "" }}

###

